    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remnants Of The Witch is a story-heavy RPG game. It takes place in a magic-based 1930s-inspired setting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience a story\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story follows Mari, who joins a witch-hunting organization to save her friend Annie. Experience her journey as she learns more about herself, her companions, and the world of witch-hunting she has entered. Joined by her comrades, she will embark on various missions to defeat the sudden appearance of the witch threat.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, some unforeseen complications will occur on this journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Spend time with squadmates</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452160/extras/59f24b1852260e9d2ff38c5e17cecb33.avif?t=1749321650\" width=722 height=260 /></span>\u00a0Spend quality time with your teammates, unlocking new abilities and learn more about them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the city</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452160/extras/f3730fa483481de8d8c40c34b914603f.avif?t=1749321650\" data-has-big width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the city of sthalgrave, encounter new people and interesting side-stories to experience. Watch the city change as the story progresses.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remnants Of The Witch is a story-heavy RPG game. It takes place in a magic-based 1930s-inspired setting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience a story\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story follows Mari, who joins a witch-hunting organization to save her friend Annie. Experience her journey as she learns more about herself, her companions, and the world of witch-hunting she has entered. Joined by her comrades, she will embark on various missions to defeat the sudden appearance of the witch threat.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, some unforeseen complications will occur on this journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Spend time with squadmates</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452160/extras/59f24b1852260e9d2ff38c5e17cecb33.avif?t=1749321650\" width=722 height=260 /></span>\u00a0Spend quality time with your teammates, unlocking new abilities and learn more about them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the city</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452160/extras/f3730fa483481de8d8c40c34b914603f.avif?t=1749321650\" data-has-big width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the city of sthalgrave, encounter new people and interesting side-stories to experience. Watch the city change as the story progresses.</p>",
    "short_description": "Follow the story of Mari, as she becomes a witch hunter and discovers what's really going on in Sthalgrave city. Use various skills in the fast-paced turn-based battles! Use free time after missions to hang out with teammates! Learn about the world of Remnants Of The Witch!",
